690914b5-3d75-4829-bd0e-dfe6f4fa0e5d	0de104e2-b3de-476d-92b9-3788b2e3f785	assistant	Perfect! I've fixed the hydration error in the AddUsersToRoleDialog component. The issue was that `ListItemText` wraps the `primary` and `secondary` props in `<p>` tags by default, but we were putting `<Chip>` components (which render as `<div>`) inside them, which violates HTML nesting rules.\n\n## Changes Made:\n\n1. **Added `component="span"` to all Box components** that are used inside `primary` and `secondary` props of `ListItemText`\n2. **Added `component="span"` to all Typography components** that contain or are siblings to Chip components\n\nThis ensures that:\n- Box renders as `<span>` instead of `<div>`\n- Typography renders as `<span>` instead of `<p>`\n- The Chip component (`<div>`) is now inside proper inline elements\n\nThe hydration error should now be resolved. The dialog will work correctly when you click the "+" button to add users to a role.	text	\N	409	f	f	\N	\N	2025-11-14 17:10:44.614+00
