a72ca219-3978-4309-a714-7d619ee5a530	195b73f0-df13-4ba7-8d24-185ee9624c82	assistant	완료되었습니다.\n\n## 변경 사항\n\n### PostDetailPage 첨부파일 표시 수정\n\n**1. API 엔드포인트 변경:**\n```typescript\n// Before (deprecated)\n/attachment/post/${postId}\n\n// After (new reference-based API)\n/attachment/reference/post/${postId}\n```\n\n**2. 인터페이스 업데이트:**\n```typescript\n// Before\ninterface Attachment {\n  original_name: string;\n  file_size: number;\n  mime_type: string;\n}\n\n// After\ninterface AttachmentFile {\n  id: string;\n  attachmentId: string;\n  originalFilename: string;\n  fileExtension: string;\n  mimeType: string;\n  fileSize: number;\n  isImage: boolean;\n  downloadCount: number;\n}\n```\n\n**3. 응답 처리:**\n- 새 API는 `attachments[].files[]` 구조로 응답\n- 모든 attachment의 files를 추출하여 평탄화\n\n**4. 다운로드 URL:**\n```typescript\n// Before\n/api/attachment/${id}/download\n\n// After (authenticated)\n/api/attachment/file/${fileId}/download?token=${token}\n```\n\n**5. 표시 개선:**\n- 파일 확장자 Chip 표시 (예: PDF, DOCX)\n- 다운로드 횟수 표시\n\n커밋: `8571b13 fix: Update PostDetailPage to use new attachment API`	text	\N	649	f	f	\N	\N	2025-11-27 19:34:49.201+00
