71cb0242-7f85-4b5e-ac6c-50f35d8a8524	278f39a4-33d8-4af8-a0bc-f116e2b040b4	assistant	## 수동 저장 가이드\n\n### 즉시 실행 (권장)\n\n```bash\nnpm run migrate:conversations\n```\n\n### 실행 결과 예시\n\n```\n============================================================\nClaude Code Conversation Migration\n============================================================\nMode: Incremental (new only)\n📊 Previously migrated: 68 sessions\n\n📁 Found 71 conversation files\n\n🔄 Processing 71 sessions...\n\nProcessing: [현재 세션 ID].jsonl\n  📝 Title: 자 지금 까지 대화를 저장하겠다...\n  💬 Messages: XX\n  🏷️  Category: feature, Difficulty: hard\n  ✅ Saved: 2025-11-29-xxx.md\n\n============================================================\n✅ New sessions processed: 1\n⏭️  Skipped (already migrated): 68\n📊 Total migrated (all time): 69\n============================================================\n```\n\n---\n\n### 다른 옵션들\n\n| 명령어 | 용도 |\n|--------|------|\n| `npm run migrate:conversations` | 새 세션만 저장 (기본) |\n| `npm run migrate:conversations:status` | 현재 상태 확인 |\n| `npm run migrate:conversations:md` | Markdown만 생성 |\n| `npm run migrate:conversations:db` | SQL만 생성 |\n\n---\n\n### 저장 후 확인\n\n```bash\n# 상태 확인\nnpm run migrate:conversations:status\n\n# 생성된 파일 확인\nls docs/claude-sessions/2025-11/\n```\n\n---\n\n### DB에 반영 (선택)\n\nSQL 파일이 생성되면:\n```bash\npsql -h localhost -U app_user -d app_db -f migration/insert_conversations_*.sql\n```	text	\N	208	f	f	\N	\N	2025-11-28 19:25:37.421+00
