  - hooks/useProgramManagement.ts (426 lines)\n     - page.tsx (415 lines)\n   - 47% reduction\n\n5. **Current Issue**: User reported 404 errors when loading the programs management page:\n   - Failed to fetch data from API endpoints\n   - Menu API 404 error\n   - This appears to be a backend API issue, not related to the refactoring\n\n**Key Patterns Established**:\n- Consistent architecture across all three pages\n- Separation of concerns: UI, business logic, types, constants, utils\n- Custom hooks for state management and API calls\n- Memoized computed values\n- Session storage for state persistence\n\n**Errors Fixed Throughout**:\n1. TypeScript errors with JSX in .ts files → changed to .tsx\n2. Type compatibility issues with i18n t function → used any type\n3. Role interface missing fields → updated constants to use correct fields\n4. Various type casting issues for status, type enums → added explicit type assertions\n5. Help viewer prop name changes (pageId → programId)\n6. SearchCriteria types needed to support string | string[] for multi-select\n\nSummary:\n1. **Primary Request and Intent**:\n   - Refactor admin pages (Users, Roles, Programs) to separate UI and business logic for better maintainability\n   - Apply consistent clean architecture pattern across all pages\n   - Use Users page as the reference pattern for subsequent refactorings\n   - Follow the principle: "화면 요소와 비즈니스 로직을 분리하여 구조를 개편"\n   - Most recently: Fix 404 errors appearing in Programs management page\n\n2. **Key Technical Concepts**:\n   - **Clean Architecture**: Separation of Concerns (SoC)\n   - **Custom React Hooks**: For business logic encapsulation\n   - **TypeScript**: Strict typing with interfaces and type assertions\n   - **Next.js 16.0.1** with Turbopack\n   - **Material-UI (MUI)**: Component library\n   - **Session Storage**: For state persistence across page reloads\n   - **Server-side Pagination**: With pagination model state\n   - **i18n**: Internationalization with useI18n hook\n   - **Pattern Consistency**: Same 5-file structure for all admin pages\n\n3. **Files and Code Sections**:\n\n   **Users Page Refactoring (604 → 242 lines)**:\n   \n   - `src/app/[locale]/admin/users/types.ts` (25 lines)\n     - Defines User and SearchCriteria interfaces\n     ```typescript\n     export interface User {\n       id: string;\n       username: string;\n       name: string;\n       email: string;\n       role: string;\n       department: string;\n       status: string;\n       // ... other fields\n     }\n     \n     export interface SearchCriteria {\n       username: string;\n       name: string;\n       email: string;\n       role: string;\n       department: string[];\n       status: string;\n       [key: string]: string | string[];\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - `src/app/[locale]/admin/users/constants.tsx` (78 lines)\n     - Added 'use client' directive for JSX\n     - Defines columns and DEPARTMENTS constant\n     ```typescript\n     export const createColumns = (\n       // eslint-disable-next-line @typescript-eslint/no-explicit-any\n       t: any,\n       handleEdit: (id: string | number) => void\n     ): GridColDef[] => [\n       { field: 'id', headerName: 'ID', width: 70 },\n       // Avatar column with renderCell...\n       // ... other columns\n     ];\n     \n     export const DEPARTMENTS = [\n       'Admin', 'Design', 'Engineering', 'Finance', 'HR', 'IT',\n       'Legal', 'Marketing', 'Operations', 'Product', 'Sales', 'Support'\n     ];\n     ```\n\n   - `src/app/[locale]/admin/users/utils.ts` (62 lines)\n     - Helper functions for filters\n     ```typescript\n     export const createFilterFields = (t: any): FilterFieldConfig[] => [\n       {\n         name: 'username',\n         label: 'Username',\n         type: 'text',\n         placeholder: 'Search by username...'\n       },\n       // ... other fields\n     ];\n     \n     export const calculateActiveFilterCount = (searchCriteria: SearchCriteria): number => {\n       return Object.entr