js 16.0.1 with App Router and Turbopack\n   - React Server Components and Client Components\n   - Material-UI (MUI) v6 components\n   - TypeScript with strict typing\n   - Clean Architecture - Separation of concerns\n   - Custom React Hooks for business logic\n   - Session storage for state persistence\n   - AuthenticatedLayout wrapper pattern\n   - Component library organization by categories\n   - Shared data patterns (single source of truth)\n   - Template-based page generation\n\n3. **Files and Code Sections**:\n\n   - **src/app/[locale]/admin/programs/page.tsx** (Lines 312, 590)\n     - Increased Edit Drawer width: `sx: { width: { xs: '100%', sm: 700, md: 800 } }`\n     - Increased Permission Edit Drawer width: `sx: { width: { xs: '100%', sm: 550, md: 600 } }`\n\n   - **backend/data/programs.json** (Lines 531-571)\n     - Added PROG-COMPONENTS program:\n     ```json\n     {\n       "id": "prog-009",\n       "code": "PROG-COMPONENTS",\n       "name": { "en": "Components", "ko": "컴포넌트" },\n       "category": "dashboard",\n       "type": "page",\n       "status": "active"\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **backend/data/menus.json** (Lines 254-271)\n     - Added menu-015 for component management\n\n   - **src/app/[locale]/admin/components/page.tsx**\n     - Created "under development" page with Construction icon\n\n   - **src/app/[locale]/dev/layout.tsx**\n     - Changed from custom Box layout to AuthenticatedLayout:\n     ```tsx\n     return (\n       <AuthenticatedLayout>\n         {children}\n       </AuthenticatedLayout>\n     );\n     ```\n\n   - **src/app/[locale]/dev/constants/componentData.ts**\n     - Created shared data structure with 20 components in 5 categories\n     - Export componentCategories array with icon, color, components\n\n   - **src/app/[locale]/dev/page.tsx**\n     - Converted to overview page showing Development Resources\n     - Displays total component count from shared data\n     - Shows category badges and navigation cards\n\n   - **src/app/[locale]/dev/components/page.tsx**\n     - Uses shared componentData via import\n     - Memoized locale transformation of paths\n     ```tsx\n     const localizedCategories = useMemo(() =>\n       componentCategories.map(category => ({\n         ...category,\n         components: category.components.map(component => ({\n           ...component,\n           href: `/${locale}${component.path}`\n         }))\n       })),\n       [locale]\n     );\n     ```\n\n   - **src/components/common/PageContainer/index.tsx** (Lines 21-29)\n     - Removed overflow: 'hidden' from fullHeight mode:\n     ```tsx\n     ...(fullHeight && {\n       height: '100%',\n       display: 'flex',\n       flexDirection: 'column'\n       // overflow: 'hidden' removed\n     })\n     ```\n\n   - **src/app/[locale]/dev/components/ComponentDemoTemplate.tsx**\n     - Created reusable template for all component demo pages\n     - Props: title, titleKo, description, descriptionKo, category, tags, importPath, children\n     - Displays component info, demo area, usage code, and documentation link\n\n   - **Component Demo Pages Created** (17 pages):\n     - empty-state/page.tsx\n     - page-header/page.tsx\n     - date-range-picker/page.tsx\n     - multi-select/page.tsx\n     - avatar-upload/page.tsx\n     - user-selector/page.tsx\n     - quick-search/page.tsx\n     - search-filter/page.tsx\n     - advanced-search/page.tsx\n     - user-search/page.tsx\n     - crud-dialog/page.tsx\n     - edit-drawer/page.tsx\n     - delete-confirm/page.tsx\n     - help-viewer/page.tsx\n     - page-container/page.tsx\n     - actions-cell/page.tsx\n     - status-menu/page.tsx\n\n4. **Errors and Fixes**:\n   - **Error**: Menu not displaying components page\n     - Fix: Added PROG-COMPONENTS program (prog-009) to programs.json because menu referenced it but it didn't exist\n     - User feedback: "변경된 내용이 화면에서 업데이트 되지 않는다"\n\n   - **Error**: Old content still showing at /dev/components\n     - Fix: Updated /dev/components/page.tsx