er wants to modify the bulk-generated component demo pages to show actual component samples\n   - Current pages use ComponentDemoTemplate which just shows documentation\n   - Need to add working examples of each component\n\nKey files worked on:\n- src/app/[locale]/dev/components/data-grid/page.tsx\n- src/components/common/DataGrid/index.tsx\n- backend/data/menus.json\n- backend/data/programs.json\n- src/app/[locale]/dev/constants/componentData.ts\n- 6 new date/time picker components\n- 6 new demo pages for date/time pickers\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   - Widen the edit drawer in Programs Management for better usability\n   - Add Action buttons to data-grid demo page with edit drawer functionality\n   - Add QuickSearch and advanced search to data-grid page\n   - Make data-grid demo page UX identical to users page\n   - Integrate PDF export into DataGrid common component (not separate button)\n   - Create "개발지원" (Dev Support) top-level menu with Components as submenu\n   - Create 6 date/time picker components based on DateRangePicker pattern: DatePicker (single date), YearPicker (year only), MonthPicker (year+month), TimePicker (time only), DateTimePicker (date+time), DateTimeRangePicker (date+time range)\n   - Remove duplicate component management menu (keep only dev > components)\n   - **Current Task**: Modify bulk-generated component demo pages to include actual working component samples instead of just documentation templates\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Next.js 16.0.1 App Router with TypeScript\n   - Material-UI (MUI) v6 components\n   - MUI X DataGrid for tables\n   - MUI X Date Pickers (DatePicker, DateTimePicker, TimePicker)\n   - dayjs for date manipulation\n   - Clean Architecture with separation of concerns\n   - Template pattern for component demo pages\n   - React useState/useMemo hooks\n   - Drawer components for edit forms\n   - QuickSearchBar and SearchFilterPanel components\n   - EmptyState component for no-data scenarios\n 