le:\n- date-picker: relativeTime, dayOfYear, weekOfYear\n- year-picker: isLeapYear\n- month-picker: quarterOfYear, localizedFormat\n- datetime-picker: localizedFormat\n\n### 6. User Request: Continue With Remaining Pages\n**User Message**: "dev > components 에서 아직도 "Demo Coming Soon" 으로 남아 있는 페이지가 있다. 실제 공통컴포넌트를 활용하여 작업을 마무리 하라."\n\nThe user identified that there were still 14 pages using ComponentDemoTemplate and requested completion of all remaining pages.\n\n### 7. Continued Work: More Component Demos\nI created additional demo pages:\n- QuickSearchBar - with search states, loading, and filter examples\n- PageHeader - with 3 usage modes (Auto, Menu Object, Manual) and action buttons\n\n### 8. Final Status Check\n**User Message**: "모두 계속 진행"\n\nThe user requested to continue with all remaining pages. At this point:\n- Completed: 12 demo pages\n- Remaining: 12 pages still using ComponentDemoTemplate\n\n## Technical Details Covered:\n\n**Technologies**:\n- Next.js 16.0.1 App Router\n- TypeScript\n- Material-UI v6\n- dayjs with plugins\n- React hooks (useState)\n\n**Key Patterns**:\n- Client components ('use client')\n- PageContainer for consistent layout\n- Paper components for sections\n- Stack for spacing\n- Chip for displaying values\n- API Reference sections in each demo\n- Multiple examples per component (basic, with defaults, various formats)\n\nSummary:\n## 1. Primary Request and Intent:\n\nThe user requested to update all bulk-generated component demo pages in `dev > components` to show actual working component samples instead of using the generic `ComponentDemoTemplate`. The goal was to provide interactive demonstrations of each common component with:\n- Multiple usage examples\n- Working state management\n- Visual feedback\n- API documentation\n- Common use cases\n\n## 2. Key Technical Concepts:\n\n- **Next.js 16.0.1 App Router** with TypeScript\n- **Material-UI (MUI) v6** components and styling system\n- **dayjs** date library with plugin system:\n  - relativeTime plugin for `fromNow()`\n  - dayOfYear plugin for `dayOfYear()`\n  - weekOfYear plugin for `week()`\n  - quarterOfYear plugin for `quarter()`\n  - isLeapYear plugin for `isLeapYear()`\n  - localizedFormat plugin for `format('LL')`, `format('LLLL')`\n- **React Client Components** ('use client' directive)\n- **React hooks**: useState for state management\n- **Component composition patterns** with PageContainer, Paper, Stack, Chip\n- **Import path aliases**: @/components/common/* vs @/components/layout/*\n\n## 3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n### Created/Updated Demo Pages:\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/datetime-range-picker/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for DateTimeRangePicker component\n- Shows dual datetime pickers with range selection and duration calculation\n```typescript\nimport DateTimeRangePicker from '@/components/common/DateTimeRangePicker';\nconst [startDateTime, setStartDateTime] = useState<Dayjs | null>(null);\nconst [endDateTime, setEndDateTime] = useState<Dayjs | null>(null);\n```\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/datetime-picker/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for DateTimePicker component with format examples\n- Added localizedFormat plugin for LLLL format\n```typescript\nimport dayjs, { Dayjs } from 'dayjs';\nimport localizedFormat from 'dayjs/plugin/localizedFormat';\ndayjs.extend(localizedFormat);\n```\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/time-picker/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for TimePicker with 24-hour format\n- Shows time selection with multiple format displays\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/month-picker/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for MonthPicker with quarter display\n- Added quarterOfYear and localizedFormat plugins\n```typescript\nimport quarterOfYear from 'dayjs/plugin/quarterOfYear';\nimport localizedFormat from 'dayjs/plugin/localizedFormat';\ndayjs.extend(quarterOfYear);\ndayjs.extend(localizedFormat);\n```\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/year-picker/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for YearPicker with leap year detection\n- Added isLeapYear plugin\n```typescript\nimport isLeapYear from 'dayjs/plugin/isLeapYear';\ndayjs.extend(isLeapYear);\n```\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/date-picker/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for DatePicker with relative time and week numbers\n- Added multiple dayjs plugins\n```typescript\nimport relativeTime from 'dayjs/plugin/relativeTime';\nimport dayOfYear from 'dayjs/plugin/dayOfYear';\nimport weekOfYear from 'dayjs/plugin/weekOfYear';\ndayjs.extend(relativeTime);\ndayjs.extend(dayOfYear);\ndayjs.extend(weekOfYear);\n```\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/date-range-picker/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for DateRangePicker with automatic time setting\n- Shows ISO format date strings with time auto-set to 00:00:00 ~ 23:59:59\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/multi-select/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for MultiSelect with checkbox selection\n- Shows HTTP methods, categories, skills, and countries examples\n```typescript\nconst [selectedMethods, setSelectedMethods] = useState<string[]>([]);\n<MultiSelect\n  label="HTTP Methods"\n  value={selectedMethods}\n  onChange={setSelectedMethods}\n  options={httpMethods}\n  allLabel="All Methods"\n/>\n```\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/empty-state/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for EmptyState component with various scenarios\n- Shows 7 different empty state examples (no results, empty inbox, empty cart, offline, etc.)\n```typescript\n<EmptyState\n  icon={Inbox}\n  title="Your inbox is empty"\n  description="All caught up! You have no new messages at the moment."\n/>\n```\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/quick-search/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for QuickSearchBar with search states\n- Shows basic usage, advanced filter button, loading states, disabled state\n```typescript\nconst [searching, setSearching] = useState(false);\n<QuickSearchBar\n  searchValue={searchValue2}\n  onSearchChange={setSearchValue2}\n  onSearch={handleSearch2}\n  searching={searching}\n  activeFilterCount={filterCount}\n/>\n```\n\n**src/app/[locale]/dev/components/page-header/page.tsx**\n- Purpose: Demo for PageHeader with 3 usage modes\n- Shows Auto mode, Manual mode with actions, Icon actions\n```typescript\n// Auto mode\n<PageHeader useMenu showBreadcrumb />\n\n// Manual mode with actions\n<PageHeader\n  title="Products"\n  description="Manage your product catalog"\n  actions={<Button>Add Product</Button>}\n/>\n```\n\n## 4. Errors and Fixes:\n\n**Error 1: Module Not Found - PageContainer Import**\n- **Error Message**: `Module not found: Can't resolve '@/components/layout/PageContainer'`\n- **Root Cause**: I incorrectly imported PageContainer from `@/components/layout/` when the actual location is `@/components/common/`\n- **Files Affected**: All 9 newly created demo pages\n- **Fix**: Changed all imports from:\n  ```typescript\n  import PageContainer from '@/components/layout/PageContainer';\n  ```\n  to:\n  ```typescript\n  import PageContainer from '@/components/common/PageContainer';\n  ```\n- **User Feedback**: User reported the build error and requested fix\n\n**Error 2: Dayjs Method Not a Function**\n- **Error Message**: `Runtime TypeError: date3.fromNow is not a function`\n- **Root Cause**: dayjs methods like `fromNow()`, `dayOfYear()`, `week()`, `quarter()`, `isLeapYear()` require plugins to be imported and extended\n- **Files Affected**: date-picker, year-picker, month-picker, datetime-picker\n- **Fix Applied**:\n  - **date-picker.tsx**: Added relativeTime, dayOfYear, weekOfYear plugins\n  - **year-picker.tsx**: Added isLeapYear plugin\n  - **month-picker.tsx**: Added quarterOfYear, localizedFormat plugins\n  - **datetime-picker.tsx**: Added localizedFormat plugin\n- **User Feedback**: User reported the runtime error and requested fix\n\n## 5. Problem Solving:\n\n**Problem**: Transform bulk-generated template pages into interactive component demonstrations\n**Solution**: Created comprehensive demo pages with:\n- Multiple usage examples (basic, with defaults, various configurations)\n- I