ign with ResponsiveContainer\n- Exported from [index.ts](src/components/common/Charts/index.ts#L22-L32)\n\nThese components are production-ready and can be used immediately in your application by importing from `@/components/common/Charts`.	text	\N	209	f	f	\N	\N	2025-11-10 13:28:50.313+00
