eBadge, PermissionGuard, NotificationCenter\n- Added comprehensive examples with variants\n- Added migration complete banner\n\n**Step 4: Rewrite loading/page.tsx**\n- Completely rewrote (327 lines)\n- Replaced Loading wrapper with: CircularProgress, LinearProgress, Skeleton, Backdrop\n- Added determinate progress examples\n- Included usage guide with code examples\n\n**Step 5: Delete Wrapper Directories**\nRemoved 15 component directories:\n```bash\nrm -rf Tooltip Progress Badge Alert Switch Modal Confirmation Tab Table Accordion Stepper Input Select Checkbox Loading\n```\n\n**Step 6: Update componentData.ts**\n- Changed descriptions to indicate "(MUI) - direct usage"\n- Updated all 15+ removed components in the data structure\n- Clarified that examples show MUI direct usage\n\n**Step 7: Build Verification**\n- Server running successfully on localhost:3000\n- All pages compiling without errors\n- No TypeScript errors\n\n### User Request 2: "바뀐 컨셉에 따라 'http://localhost:3000/ko/dev/components' page를 다시 분류하고 정리하라."\nTranslation: "Reclassify and reorganize the component library page according to the changed concept."\n\n### My Approach to Request 2:\n\n**Step 1: Completely Restructure componentData.ts**\nCreated new organization with 9 categories (from previous 11):\n\n1. **Theme System** (1 component)\n   - Theme Demo\n\n2. **MUI Components (Direct Usage)** (2 demos)\n   - All UI Components\n   - Loading Indicators\n\n3. **Data Management** (3 components)\n   - DataGrid, Search & Filter Panel, Quick Search Bar\n\n4. **Form Components** (8 components)\n   - CRUD Dialog, Advanced Search Dialog, User Search/Selector\n   - Multi Select, Rich Text Editor, File/Avatar Upload\n\n5. **Date & Time Pickers** (7 components)\n   - Date, DateRange, Time, DateTime, DateTimeRange, Year, Month pickers\n\n6. **Dialogs & Modals** (3 components)\n   - Delete Confirm, Edit Drawer, Help Viewer\n\n7. **Business Logic Components** (7 components)\n   - Page Header, Actions Cell, Status Menu\