nstants/componentData.ts** - Completely restructured (318 lines)\n6. **src/app/[locale]/dev/components/page.tsx** - Updated intro and strategy section\n7. **docs/MIGRATION_COMPLETE.md** - Created comprehensive migration document\n\n## Errors:\nNo errors encountered during this session. Build and server running successfully.\n\n## User Messages:\n1. "공통컴포넌트 중 단순래핑한 컴포넌트는 삭제하고 관련 예제페이지는 MUI 를 사용하는 예제로 전환한다."\n2. "바뀐 컨셉에 따라 'http://localhost:3000/ko/dev/components' page를 다시 분류하고 정리하라."\n\nBoth requests were fully completed.\n\nSummary:\n## 1. Primary Request and Intent\n\nThe user had two sequential requests in this session:\n\n**Request 1**: "공통컴포넌트 중 단순래핑한 컴포넌트는 삭제하고 관련 예제페이지는 MUI 를 사용하는 예제로 전환한다."\n- Delete simple wrapper components from the codebase\n- Convert related example pages to use MUI directly instead of wrappers\n- This was implementing Phase 2 of the component strategy from the previous session\n\n**Request 2**: "바뀐 컨셉에 따라 'http://localhost:3000/ko/dev/components' page를 다시 분류하고 정리하라."\n- Reclassify and reorganize the component library landing page\n- Align with the new MUI-first architectural concept\n- Make the new organization clear and well-structured\n\n## 2. Key Technical Concepts\n\n- **Next.js 16.0.1** with App Router and TypeScript\n- **Material-UI (MUI) v6** - Direct component usage without wrappers\n- **Theme System Architecture** - Custom palette, typography, component overrides\n- **Component Abstraction Principles** - When to abstract vs when to use library directly\n- **MUI-First Approach** - Prefer MUI direct usage, only create custom components for business logic\n- **React Patterns** - useState, useMemo, flatMap, hooks\n- **TypeScript** - Full type safety\n- **dayjs** - Date/time standardization\n- **TipTap** - Rich text editor\n- **Recharts** - Chart library\n- **Express.js** - Backend API\n- **Design System** - Theme-based consistency\n\n## 3. Files and Code Sections\n\n### Files Modified - Phase 2 (Request 1)\n\n#### src/app/[locale]/dev/components/ui-components/page.tsx\n**Why Important**: Main UI components demo page showing MUI direct usage examples\n**Changes**: Completely rewritten from 279 lines to 714 lines\n\n**Key Code Snippet**:\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Box, Typography, Grid, Button, CircularProgress, LinearProgress,\n  Tooltip as MuiTooltip, Alert as MuiAlert, AlertTitle, TextField,\n  Select as MuiSelect, MenuItem, FormControl, InputLabel,\n  Switch as MuiSwitch, FormControlLabel, Checkbox as MuiCheckbox,\n  Badge as MuiBadge, Chip, Dialog, DialogTitle, DialogContent,\n  DialogActions, Tabs, Tab as MuiTab, Table as MuiTable,\n  TableBody, TableCell, TableContainer, TableHead, TableRow,\n  Accordion as MuiAccordion, AccordionSummary, AccordionDetails,\n  Stepper as MuiStepper, Step, StepLabel, Menu as MuiMenu,\n  Skeleton, IconButton, Divider, Card as MuiCard,\n  CardContent, CardHeader\n} from '@mui/material';\n\n// Keep business logic components\nimport Status from '@/components/common/Status';\nimport PermissionGuard from '@/components/common/PermissionGuard';\nimport RoleBadge from '@/components/common/RoleBadge';\nimport NotificationCenter from '@/components/common/Notification';\n```\n\n**Demonstrates**: 15+ MUI components with comprehensive examples including CircularProgress with determinate progress, Alerts with titles, TextField variants, Select with icons, Switch/Checkbox states, Tabs with TabPanel, Table with hover, Accordion, Stepper, Dialog patterns.\n\n#### src/app/[locale]/dev/components/loading/page.tsx\n**Why Important**: Loading indicators demo page showing MUI alternatives to wrapper component\n**Changes**: Completely rewritten from 75 lines to 327 lines\n\n**Key Code Snippet**:\n```typescript\nimport {\n  Box, Typography, Paper, Divider, Grid, Button,\n  CircularProgress, LinearProgress, Skeleton, Backdrop\n} from '@mui/material';\n\n// Circular with determinate progress\n<Box position="relative" display="inline-flex">\n  <CircularProgress variant="determinate" 