tion\n4. Updated component descriptions to clearly indicate MUI vs custom\n\n**Result**: Clear decision framework for component usage throughout the application.\n\n## 6. All User Messages\n\n1. **Initial System Reminder**: Summary of previous session work on theme system and component strategy analysis\n2. **User Request 1**: "공통컴포넌트 중 단순래핑한 컴포넌트는 삭제하고 관련 예제페이지는 MUI 를 사용하는 예제로 전환한다."\n3. **User Request 2**: "바뀐 컨셉에 따라 'http://localhost:3000/ko/dev/components' page를 다시 분류하고 정리하라."\n\n## 7. Pending Tasks\n\n**No pending tasks.** All requested work has been completed:\n\n- ✅ Phase 1: Theme System (completed in previous session)\n- ✅ Phase 2: Remove wrapper components and convert examples to MUI\n- ✅ Phase 3: Reorganize component library page\n\nOptional Phase 4 (not explicitly requested):\n- Enhance 37 core components with theme consistency\n- Add Storybook documentation\n- Add unit tests\n- Improve accessibility\n\n## 8. Current Work\n\n**Immediately before this summary request, I was completing the reorganization of the component library.**\n\nThe last task completed was creating **docs/MIGRATION_COMPLETE.md**, a comprehensive migration documentation that:\n- Documents the entire migration from 52 to 37 components\n- Explains the new 9-category organization\n- Provides before/after code examples\n- Lists all removed components with their MUI equivalents\n- Includes demo links and checklist\n\nThe work session successfully completed all requested tasks:\n1. ✅ Deleted 15 simple wrapper components\n2. ✅ Rewrote ui-components example page with MUI direct usage\n3. ✅ Rewrote loading example page with MUI direct usage\n4. ✅ Restructured componentData.ts into 9 focused categories\n5. ✅ Updated component library landing page with MUI-first messaging\n6. ✅ Created comprehensive migration documentation\n\n**Server Status**: Running successfully at http://localhost:3000 with no errors.\n\n## 9. Optional Next Step\n\n**No immediate next step required.** All user requests have been fully completed.\n\nThe user's most recent request was: "바뀐 컨셉에 따라 'http://localhost:3000/ko/dev/components' page를 다시 분류하고 정리하라."\n\nThis has been completed with:\n- componentData.ts restructured into 9 logical categories\n- Component library page updated with MUI-first messaging\n- Component Strategy guide added\n- Migration documentation created\n\nIf continuing work, potential next steps would be:\n1. Review the reorganized component library at http://localhost:3000/ko/dev/components to ensure it meets expectations\n2. Optionally proceed with Phase 4: enhance the 37 retained components with consistent theme application\n3. Test the application thoroughly to ensure all MUI direct usage examples work correctly\n\nHowever, these should only be pursued if the user explicitly requests them, as the current tasks are complete..\nPlease continue the conversation from where we left it off without asking the user any further questions. Continue with the last task that you were asked to work on.	text	\N	573	f	f	\N	\N	2025-11-10 18:36:34.069+00
