ror, warning, info)\n   - CODE_TYPE_CATEGORY (user, organization, system, workflow, common)\n   - DEPARTMENT (12 departments)\n   - ICON_TYPE (for Material-UI icons)\n   - ROLE_CATEGORY (general, management)\n\n3. Added 31 new codes (code-042 to code-072) to `backend/data/codes.json`\n\n4. Created `useCodeOptions` hook with 3 functions:\n   - useCodeOptions: fetch single code type\n   - useCodeOption: get single code by value\n   - useMultipleCodeOptions: fetch multiple code types at once\n\n5. Modified codes page as example:\n   - Updated `src/app/[locale]/admin/codes/constants.tsx` to accept statusOptions parameter\n   - Updated `src/app/[locale]/admin/codes/utils.ts` to accept statusOptions parameter\n   - Updated `src/app/[locale]/admin/codes/page.tsx` to use useCodeOptions hook\n\n6. Created documentation: `docs/CODE_MANAGEMENT_INTEGRATION.md`\n\n**Fourth Request (Message 4):**\nUser requested to create common Select components that automatically load options by just providing codeType, and apply them throughout the app.\n\n**My Implementation:**\n1. Created `CodeSelect` component (`src/components/common/CodeSelect/index.tsx`):\n   - Single select dropdown\n   - Auto-loads options from code type\n   - Supports loading state, error handling\n   - Multi-language support\n   - Optional empty option\n\n2. Created `CodeMultiSelect` component (`src/components/common/CodeMultiSelect/index.tsx`):\n   - Multi-select dropdown\n   - Checkbox support\n   - Chip rendering for selected items\n   - Max chips display control\n\n3. Applied CodeSelect to 5 files, replacing 8 hardcoded selects:\n   - **UserFormFields.tsx** (3 uses): USER_ROLE, DEPARTMENT, COMMON_STATUS\n   - **CodeFormFields.tsx** (1 use): COMMON_STATUS\n   - **DepartmentFormFields.tsx** (1 use): COMMON_STATUS\n   - **MessageFormFields.tsx** (1 use): COMMON_STATUS\n   - **CodeTypeFormFields.tsx** (2 uses): CODE_TYPE_CATEGORY, COMMON_STATUS\n\n4. Created comprehensive documentation: `docs/CODE_SELECT_COMPONENTS.md`\n\n**Fifth Request (Message 5):**\nUser asked to show where CodeSelect is being used.\n\n**My Response:**\n- Created detailed usage report: `docs/CODE_SELECT_USAGE_REPORT.md`\n- Showed 8 usages across 5 files\n- COMMON_STATUS is most used (5 times, 62.5%)\n- Calculated 54% code reduction (104 lines → 48 lines)\n- CodeMultiSelect not yet used anywhere\n\n**Sixth Request (Most Recent):**\nUser wants to add CodeSelect and CodeMultiSelect usage examples to the dev components showcase page at `src/app/[locale]/dev/components/page.tsx`\n\nSummary:\n1. **Primary Request and Intent:**\n   - **Initial**: Fix AxiosError 403 when calling `/user/preferences` API in LanguageLoader\n   - **Second**: Review and understand the codes management page structure\n   - **Third**: Find all hardcoded values throughout the codebase, convert them to code management system, add necessary code types and codes to database\n   - **Fourth**: Create reusable CodeSelect/CodeMultiSelect components that automatically load options from code type, then replace all hardcoded selects with these components\n   - **Fifth**: Generate a report showing where CodeSelect components are being used\n   - **Sixth (Current)**: Add usage examples of CodeSelect and CodeMultiSelect to the dev components showcase page\n\n2. **Key Technical Concepts:**\n   - Code Management System with database-driven dropdown options\n   - HTTP status code semantics (401 vs 403)\n   - Axios interceptors for automatic token refresh\n   - React custom hooks (useCodeOptions)\n   - Material-UI Select components\n   - Master-Detail layout pattern\n   - Multi-language support with locale-based labels\n   - Type-safe TypeScript interfaces\n\n3. **Files and Code Sections:**\n\n   **Backend Auth Fix:**\n   - `backend/middleware/auth.js` (line 29)\n     - Changed from 403 to 401 for invalid/expired tokens\n     - Critical fix for axios interceptor to work properly\n     ```javascript\n     return res.status(401).json({ error: 'Invalid or expired token' });\n     ```\n\n   **LanguageLoader Enhancement:**\n   - `src/components/providers/LanguageLoader.tsx`\n     - Added token existence check before API call\n     - Added graceful error handling for 403/401\n     ```typescript\n     if (error?.response?.status === 403 || error?.response?.status === 401) {\n       console.log('[LanguageLoader] Authentication required - user preferences not loaded');\n     }\n     ```\n\n   **Code Management Database:**\n   - `backend/data/codeTypes.json`\n     - Added 7 new code types (COMMON_STATUS, MESSAGE_CATEGORY, MESSAGE_TYPE, CODE_TYPE_CATEGORY, DEPARTMENT, ICON_TYPE, ROLE_CATEGORY)\n     \n   - `backend/data/codes.json`\n     - Added 31 new codes (code-042 to code-072)\n     - Includes multi-language names and descriptions for all codes\n\n   **useCodeOptions Hook:**\n   - `src/hooks/useCodeOptions.ts` (Complete file)\n     - Three exported hooks for different use cases\n     ```typescript\n     export function useCodeOptions(codeType: string, locale: string = 'en', autoFetch: boolean = true)\n     export function useCodeOption(codeType: string, codeValue: string | null | undefined, locale: string = 'en')\n     export function useMultipleCodeOptions(codeTypes: string[], locale: string = 'en')\n     ```\n\n   **CodeSelect Component:**\n   - `src/components/common/CodeSelect/index.tsx` (Complete new file)\n     - Single select with automatic option loading\n     - Key props: codeType, value, onChange, label, showEmpty, locale\n     ```tsx\n     <CodeSelect\n       codeType="COMMON_STATUS"\n       value={status}\n       onChange={setStatus}\n       label="Status"\n       required\n     />\n     ```\n\n   **CodeMultiSelect Component:**\n   - `src/components/common/CodeMultiSelect/index.tsx` (Complete new file)\n     - Multi-select with checkboxes and chip rendering\n     - Key props: codeType, value (array), onChange, showCheckbox, renderChips\n     ```tsx\n     <CodeMultiSelect\n       codeType="DEPARTMENT"\n       value={departments}\n       onChange={setDepartments}\n       label="Departments"\n       showCheckbox\n       renderChips\n     />\n     ```\n\n   **Applied in UserFormFields:**\n   - `src/components/admin/UserFormFields.tsx`\n     - Removed FormControl, InputLabel, Select, MenuItem imports\n     - Removed DEFAULT_DEPARTMENTS constant\n     - Added 3 CodeSelect usages:\n     ```tsx\n     <CodeSelect codeType="USER_ROLE" value={user.role || 'user'} onChange={(value) => handleChange('role', value)} label="Role" required />\n     <CodeSelect codeType="DEPARTMENT" value={user.department || ''} onChange={(value) => handleChange('department', value)} label="Department" showEmpty emptyLabel="None" />\n     <CodeSelect codeType="COMMON_STATUS" value={user.status || 'active'} onChange={(value) => handleChange('status', value)} label="Status" required />\n     ```\n\n   **Applied in CodeTypeFormFields:**\n   - `src/components/admin/CodeTypeFormFields.tsx`\n     - Removed CATEGORIES hardcoded array\n     - Removed FormControl, InputLabel, Select, MenuItem imports\n     - Added 2 CodeSelect usages with locale prop\n\n   **Applied in CodeFormFields:**\n   - `src/components/admin/CodeFormFields.tsx`\n     - Replaced status Select with CodeSelect for COMMON_STATUS\n\n   **Applied in DepartmentFormFields:**\n   - `src/components/admin/DepartmentFormFields.tsx`\n     - Replaced status Select with CodeSelect for COMMON_STATUS\n\n   **Applied in MessageFormFields:**\n   - `src/components/admin/MessageFormFields.tsx`\n     - Replaced status Select with CodeSelect for COMMON_STATUS\n\n   **Documentation Created:**\n   - `docs/CODE_MANAGEMENT_INTEGRATION.md` - Integration guide for code system\n   - `docs/CODE_SELECT_COMPONENTS.md` - Complete usage guide for CodeSelect/CodeMultiSelect\n   - `docs/CODE_SELECT_USAGE_REPORT.md` - Detailed usage statistics and analysis\n\n4. **Errors and Fixes:**\n   - **String replacement error in MessageFormFields.tsx**: Initial replacement string didn't match exact whitespace/formatting. Fixed by reading the file again and using exact match from file content.\n   - **Wrong HTTP status code in auth middleware**: Backend was returning 403 for expired tokens, but axios interceptor only handles 401. Fixed by changing status code to 401 which is semantically correct (authentication failed vs permission denied).\n\n5. **Problem Solving:**\n   - **403 Error Root Cause**: Identified that the issue was not in the LanguageLoader component itself but in the HTTP status code semantics. The backend was using 403 (Forbidden) for authentication failures when it should use 401 (Unauthorized).\n   - **Hardcoding Discovery**: Found 50+ hardcoded values across multiple files using systematic grep searches\n   - **Code Reduction**: Achieved 54% code reduction (13 lines → 6 lines per Select) by creating reusable components\n   - **Consistency**: Ensured all replaced Selects use the same API and patterns\n\n6. **All User Messages:**\n   - "아래 오류의 원인을 설명하고 해결하라." (with 403 error screenshot)\n   - "@src\\app\\[locale]\\admin\\codes 코드관리를 확인 해 줘."\n   - "소스에서 코드화 하기 않고 하드코딩한 부분을 찾아 코드화 하고 코드타입을 추가하라."\n   - "코드타입만 입력하면 코드타입에 해당하는 코드목록으로 싱글 SELECT 컴포넌트 또는 멀티 SELECT 할 수 이쓴 컴포넌트를 쉽게 활요할 수 있는 공통콤포넌트를 만들어 활용가능 한 곳에는 공통 컴포넌트를 활용하라."\n   - "src\\components\\common\\CodeSelect 를 얼마나 사용했는지 확인할 수 있도록 사용처를 알려 줘."\n   - "@src\\app\\[locale]\\dev\\components\\page.tsx 코드 공통 싱글 SELECT, 멀티 SEELCT 사용 예제를 추가 해 줘."\n\n7. **Pending Tasks:**\n   - Add CodeSelect and CodeMultiSelect usage examples to the dev components showcase page (`src/app/[locale]/dev/components/page.tsx`)\n\n8. **Current Work:**\n   Just completed reading the dev components page at `src/app/[locale]/dev/components/page.tsx` (171 lines). This page displays a component library with categories like Layout, Forms, Data Display, etc. It uses componentCategories from `../constants/componentData`. The page shows component cards in a grid layout with tags and descriptions. User wants to add examples 