sage()`.\n\n9. **Current Work - Mail Layout**: User requested:\n   - New layout for mail (not using StandardCrudPageLayout)\n   - Fix scroll issues when reading mail body\n   - Minimize space in compose page\n\n   Started by modifying `mail/layout.tsx` to use `fullBleed` prop on `AuthenticatedLayout`.\n\nKey files modified:\n- `backend/middleware/permissionMiddleware.js` - Added `isUserAdmin()` and `requireAdmin()`\n- `backend/routes/userRoleMapping.js` - Updated admin checks\n- `backend/routes/role.js` - Updated admin checks\n- `backend/services/mappingService.js` - Fixed ID generation length\n- `src/components/admin/UserFormFields.tsx` - Removed Role Assignment section\n- `src/app/[locale]/mail/components/MailPageContent.tsx` - Complete toolbar redesign\n- `src/app/[locale]/mail/layout.tsx` - Changed to fullBleed mode\n\nCurrent incomplete work: Mail layout changes - just updated layout.tsx but still need to update:\n- `[folder]/page.tsx` - Remove StandardCrudPageLayout wrapper\n- `compose/page.tsx` - Remove StandardCrudPageLayout wrapper\n- Fix scroll issues in mail content display\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   - Fix role assignment errors in user management pages (403/500 errors)\n   - Fix user-role-mapping page 500 error (ID too long for varchar(50))\n   - Remove Role Assignment UI from Users page (use dedicated mapping page instead)\n   - Redesign mail inbox toolbar to be modern, icon-only, minimal\n   - Fix mail unread count not updating when reading messages\n   - **Current**: Create new mail layout without StandardCrudPageLayout, fix scroll issues, minimize unnecessary space\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - RBAC (Role-Based Access Control) vs legacy role checking\n   - JWT token payload structure (userId, username, role)\n   - PostgreSQL varchar(50) constraint and ID generation\n   - Next.js App Router layouts with `fullBleed` prop\n   - React hooks for mail data management (useMailData)\n   - MUI components (IconButton, Tooltip, Badge, alpha)\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - **`backend/middleware/permissionMiddleware.js`** - Added RBAC-aware admin check\n     ```javascript\n     async function isUserAdmin(req) {\n       if (req.user?.role === 'admin') {\n         return true;\n       }\n       try {\n         const userId = req.user?.userId;\n         if (!userId) return false;\n         const userRoleMappings = await mappingService.getUserRoleMappingsByUserId(userId, true);\n         const hasAdminRole = userRoleMappings.some(m =>\n           m.is_active && (m.role_id === 'role-001' || m.role_name === 'admin')\n         );\n         return hasAdminRole;\n       } catch (error) {\n         console.error('[isUserAdmin] Error:', error.message);\n         return false;\n       }\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **`backend/services/mappingService.js`** - Fixed ID length issue\n     ```javascript\n     async function createUserRoleMapping(data) {\n       const { userId, roleId, assignedBy, expiresAt, isActive } = data;\n       // Generate shorter ID to fit varchar(50)\n       const timestamp = Date.now().toString().slice(-8);\n       const shortUserId = userId.length > 12 ? userId.slice(0, 12) : userId;\n       const shortRoleId = roleId.replace('role-', 'R');\n       const mappingId = `URM-${shortUserId}-${shortRoleId}-${timestamp}`;\n       // ... rest of function\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **`backend/routes/userRoleMapping.js`** - Updated to use isUserAdmin\n     ```javascript\n     const { isUserAdmin } = require('../middleware/permissionMiddleware');\n     // In POST/PUT/DELETE handlers:\n     const hasAdminAccess = await isUserAdmin(req);\n     if (!hasAdminAccess) {\n       return res.status(403).json({ error: 'Forbidden: Admin access required' });\n     }\n     ```\n\n   - **`src/components/admin/UserFormFields.tsx`** - Removed Role Assignment section and unused imports\n\n   - **`src/app/[locale]/mail/components/MailPageContent.tsx`** - Complete redesign with icon toolbar\n     - Changed from Button+Tabs to IconButton-based toolbar\n     - Added expandable search, inline bulk actions, pagination in toolbar\n     - Updated handleSelectMessage to call markAsRead for unread count fix\n\n   - **`src/app/[locale]/mail/layout.tsx`** - Just modified to use fullBleed\n     ```javascript\n     export default function MailLayout({ children }: { children: React.ReactNode }) {\n       return (\n         <AuthenticatedLayout fullBleed>\n           {children}\n         </AuthenticatedLayout>\n       );\n     }\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - **403 Forbidden on role assignment**: Legacy `req.user.role !== 'admin'` check didn't work with RBAC. Fixed by creating `isUserAdmin()` that checks both legacy and RBAC roles.\n   - **500 Internal Server Error - "value too long for type character varying(50)"**: Mapping ID `URM-{userId}-{roleId}-{timestamp}` exceeded 50 chars with UUID userIds. Fixed by truncating userId to 12 chars, abbreviating roleId, and using only last 8 digits of timestamp.\n   - **Mail unread count not updating**: Backend auto-marks as read but frontend didn't refresh counts. Fixed by calling `markAsRead()` in `handleSelectMessage()` which updates local state and fetches counts.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Identified RBAC vs legacy role system conflict through code analysis\n   - Used PostgreSQL direct queries to verify database constraints\n   - Tested ID generation with both short and UUID-style user IDs\n   - Traced mail read flow through frontend hook and backend service\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - "backend" (initial exploration)\n   - "backend 기동시 더이상 로컬빌드가 진행되지 않는 원인을 확인하라" (interrupted)\n   - "http://localhost:3000/ko/admin/users 에서 role assign 실행시 오류를 수정하라"\n   - "http://localhost:3000/ko/admin/user-role-mapping 에서 역할에 사용자를 할당하면 오류가 발생하는데 이를 해결하라. Failed to load resource: the server responded with a status of 500"\n   - "여전히 아래 오류가 발생한다. xhr.js:198 POST http://localhost:3001/api/user-role-mapping 500"\n   - Provided backend error log show