starting from Phase 0, now proceeding to Phase 1\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - Next.js 16 + Express.js fullstack application\n   - PostgreSQL database (remote: <REDACTED_IP>:9090)\n   - MSA with 5 services: Auth(3011), Admin(3012), Content(3013), Communication(3014), Common(3015)\n   - Strangler Fig Pattern for migration\n   - Environment-based API routing (development: direct calls, production: via API Gateway)\n   - Nginx as Load Balancer (server only)\n   - Apache APISIX as API Gateway (server only)\n   - Docker Compose for server deployment only\n   - Shared library (@enterprise/shared) for common code\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   - **src/lib/api/config.ts** - Environment-based API configuration\n     ```typescript\n     const API_CONFIG: ApiConfig = {\n       development: {\n         auth: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_API_URL || 'http://localhost:3011',\n         admin: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_API_URL || 'http://localhost:3012',\n         content: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_CONTENT_API_URL || 'http://localhost:3013',\n         comm: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_COMM_API_URL || 'http://localhost:3014',\n         common: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_COMMON_API_URL || 'http://localhost:3015',\n         legacy: process.env.NEXT_PUBLIC_LEGACY_API_URL || 'http://localhost:3001/api',\n       },\n       production: {\n         auth: '/auth',\n         admin: '/admin',\n         content: '/content',\n         comm: '/comm',\n         common: '/common',\n         legacy: '/api',\n       },\n     };\n     ```\n\n   - **shared/** - Complete shared library structure:\n     - types/: user.ts, auth.ts, api.ts, common.ts\n     - utils/: jwt.ts, password.ts, response.ts, validation.ts\n     - middleware/: auth.ts, errorHandler.ts, logger.ts, requestLogger.ts\n     - config/: database.ts, env.ts\n     - constants/: index.ts\n\n   - **services/auth-service/src/server.ts** - Service template:\n     ```typescript\n     import express from 'express';\n     import cors from 'cors';\n     import { loadAppConfig, getLogger, errorHandler, notFoundHandler, requestLogger } from '@enterprise/shared';\n     \n     const config = loadAppConfig('auth-service');\n     const logger = getLogger('auth-service');\n     const app = express();\n     \n     app.use(cors({ origin: config.cors.origins, credentials: true }));\n     app.use(express.json());\n     app.use(requestLogger);\n     \n     app.get('/health', (req, res) => {\n       res.json({ status: 'healthy', service: 'auth-service', timestamp: new Date().toISOString() });\n     });\n     \n     const PORT = config.port || 3011;\n     app.listen(PORT, () => { logger.info(`Auth Service started on port ${PORT}`); });\n     ```\n\n   - **infrastructure/docker/docker-compose.yml** - Server deployment configuration with Nginx, APISIX, etcd, Redis, and all microservices\n\n   - **infrastructure/apisix/apisix.yaml** - APISIX routing configuration for all services\n\n   - **package.json** - Updated with MSA scripts:\n     ```json\n     "dev:auth": "cd services/auth-service && npm run dev",\n     "dev:admin": "cd services/admin-service && npm run dev",\n     "dev:content": "cd services/content-service && npm run dev",\n     "dev:comm": "cd services/communication-service && npm run dev",\n     "dev:common": "cd services/common-service && npm run dev",\n     "dev:services": "concurrently \\"npm run dev:auth\\" \\"npm run dev:admin\\" \\"npm run dev:content\\" \\"npm run dev:comm\\" \\"npm run dev:common\\""\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No significant errors encountered during implementation\n   - User feedback led to architecture change: removed Docker from local development environment\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Designed hybrid environment strategy separating local (no Docker) from server (Docker + API Gateway)\n   - Created shared library to avoid code duplication across microservices\n   - Implemented environment-based API configuration for seamless local/production switching\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - "자 지금까지 프로젝트 전체 구조를 분석하라."\n   - "지금은 backend 하나의 서비스와 frontend 하나의 서비스로 구성되어 있다. 앞으로 비즈니스 프로세스를 추가 할 때 독립적으로 운영이 가능 하도록 msa 서비스로 분할하여 운영하고자 한다. 적절한 서비스로 분할 가이드를 제시하라. 작제 조갠다고 좋은 것이 아니어서 각 서비스르 효율적으로 운영할 수 있는 관점에서 최적안을 제시하라."\n   - "좋아. 이 구조로 진행하기 위한 실행 계획을 작성하라. 1) Load Balancer 는 Nginx 를 사용한다. 2) API Gateway 는 APISIX 를 검토한다. 3) 서버에서 각 서비스는 Docker Compose 로 구동한다. 4) 당장은 데이터베이스 분리 전략은 채택하지 않는다. (현상태 유지 논리적 분리, 물리적 분리는 단계적으로 추진) 5) frontend 서비스 운영 전략 또는 분리여부를 검토한다. 6) 마이그레이션 전략을 포함한다. 7) 추가 검토 필요사항이낭 의사결정 필요사항 정의"\n   - "나는 로컬 개발 환경을 Windows pc 에서 개발 중이다. 로컬 개발 환경을 어떻게 구성해야 하는가?"\n   - "로컬 개발 환경에서 Docker 환경을 구성하기 쉽지 않다. 로컬 개발 환경에서 Frontend 에서 backend 를 직접 호출하고 서버에서만 API Gateway를 활용하는 방법으로 구성이 가능한가?"\n   - "이 방식으로 진행하고 문서와 설정 파일을 이에 맞게 수정하라."\n   - "지금 까지 변경사항을 git 에 commit 하라."\n   - "Phase 0: 사전 준비 단계부터 진행하라."\n   - "Phase 1: 서버 인프라 구축 (Docker Compose, APISIX 설정) 을 진행하라."\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Complete Phase 1: Server Infrastructure Setup\n     - Finalize Docker Compose configuration\n     - Complete Nginx configuration\n     - Complete APISIX configuration with JWT and Rate Limiting\n     - Create Dockerfiles for all services (Frontend, Legacy Backend, 5 microservices)\n     - Create deployment scripts\n     - Git commit Phase 1 changes\n\n8. Current Work:\n   User requested: "Phase 1: 서버 인프라 구축 (Docker Compose, APISIX 설정) 을 진행하라."\n   \n   I created a todo list for Phase 1 tasks and was reading the existing `infrastructure/docker/docker-compose.yml` file to verify its current state before making enhancements. The file reading was completed successfully showing the existing configuration with Nginx, etcd, APISIX, Redis, Frontend, and all 5 microservices.\n\n   Current Git state:\n   - Branch: 16-msa\n   - Last commit: `82754aa feat: Phase 0 - MSA 기반 구조 및 공유 라이브러리 구축`\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Continue Phase 1 implementation by:\n   1. Creating Dockerfiles for all services (Frontend, Legacy Backend, and all microservices)\n   2. Enhancing AP