f100c5e0-2e51-4d57-95f7-5b574fb28bc8	0b487435-fec3-4b0d-9add-c25cf4b49be4	assistant	`.gitignore`에 다음 항목들을 추가하고 커밋했습니다:\n\n```gitignore\n# Services (MSA)\nservices/*/node_modules/\nservices/*/dist/\nservices/*/*.log\nservices/*/package-lock.json\n\n# Shared library\nshared/node_modules/\nshared/dist/\n\n# Infrastructure\ninfrastructure/*/data/\ninfrastructure/*/logs/\n```\n\n이제 `services/auth-service/node_modules/`와 `services/auth-service/package-lock.json`이 git에서 무시됩니다.	text	\N	315	f	f	\N	\N	2025-12-08 14:15:51.362+00
