0c0013e3-9311-4173-86a9-54a23beb358f	0b487435-fec3-4b0d-9add-c25cf4b49be4	assistant	## 로컬 테스트 가이드\n\n### 1. 사전 요구사항 확인\n\n현재 환경에서 이미 실행 중인 서비스:\n- **PostgreSQL**: `<REDACTED_IP>:9090` (외부 DB)\n- **Redis**: 로컬에서 실행 필요\n\n### 2. Redis 실행\n\n```bash\n# 방법 1: Docker로 Redis만 실행\ndocker run -d --name redis -p 6379:6379 redis:7-alpine\n\n# 방법 2: 인프라 docker-compose에서 redis만 실행\ncd infrastructure/docker\ndocker-compose up -d redis\n```\n\n### 3. Auth Service 환경 설정\n\n```bash\n# .env 파일 생성\ncd services/auth-service\ncp .env.example .env\n```\n\n`.env` 파일 수정:\n```env\n# Server\nPORT=3011\nNODE_ENV=development\n\n# Database (기존 DB 사용)\nDB_HOST=<REDACTED_IP>\nDB_PORT=9090\nDB_NAME=corenextdb\nDB_USER=corenext\nDB_PASSWORD=<REDACTED>\n\n# JWT\nJWT_SECRET=<REDACTED>\nJWT_REFRESH_SECRET=<REDACTED>\n\n# Redis\nREDIS_URL=redis://localhost:6379\n\n# CORS\nCORS_ORIGINS=http://localhost:3000\n```\n\n### 4. Auth Service 실행\n\n```bash\ncd services/auth-service\nnpm install   # 이미 설치됨\nnpm run dev   # 개발 모드 실행\n```\n\n### 5. API 테스트 (curl)\n\n```bash\n# Health Check\ncurl http://localhost:3011/health\n\n# 로그인 테스트\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3011/auth/login \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"username": "admin", "password": "your-password"}'\n\n# 토큰 갱신\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3011/auth/refresh \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"refreshToken": "your-refresh-token"}'\n\n# 토큰 검증\ncurl http://localhost:3011/auth/validate \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer your-access-token"\n\n# 로그아웃\ncurl -X POST http://localhost:3011/auth/logout \\\n  -H "Authorization: Bearer your-access-token" \\\n  -H "Content-Type: application/json" \\\n  -d '{"refreshToken": "your-refresh-token"}'\n```\n\n### 6. Frontend와 통합 테스트\n\n```bash\n# 터미널 1: Auth Service\ncd services/auth-service && npm run dev\n\n# 터미널 2: Frontend (Next.js)\ncd E:/apps/nextjs-enterprise-app && npm run dev\n```\n\nFrontend `.env.local`에 추가:\n```env\nNEXT_PUBLIC_AUTH_API_URL=http://localhost:3011\n```\n\n바로 테스트를 시작하시겠습니까?	text	\N	328	f	f	\N	\N	2025-12-08 14:19:47.886+00
