e.json ./\n\n     # Install production dependencies only and link shared\n     RUN npm install --omit=dev && \\\n         rm -rf node_modules/@enterprise/shared && \\\n         mkdir -p node_modules/@enterprise && \\\n         ln -s /shared node_modules/@enterprise/shared\n\n     USER service\n     EXPOSE 3011\n     CMD ["node", "dist/server.js"]\n     ```\n\n4. Errors and Fixes:\n   - **Docker build error: `sh: tsc: not found`**\n     - Cause: Dockerfiles used `npm install --omit=dev` for shared package build\n     - TypeScript is in devDependencies, so `tsc` command wasn't available\n     - Error message: `> @enterprise/shared@1.0.0 build` → `> tsc` → `sh: tsc: not found`\n     - Fix: Changed all 5 Dockerfiles to use `npm install` (without --omit=dev) in builder stage, only use `--omit=dev` in final runner stage\n     - Also added proper shared package symlink in both builder and runner stages\n\n   - **File modification conflicts**: Multiple "File has been unexpectedly modified" errors\n     - Fix: Used Bash commands with `cat >` heredocs or created helper JS scripts to write files\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - roleMenuMapping: Determined migration not needed as DB table was removed\n   - logAnalytics: Successfully migrated with full Legacy compatibility\n   - Swagger: Implemented CDN-based Swagger UI without npm dependencies\n   - Docker: Fixed TypeScript compilation by proper dependency management in multi-stage builds\n\n6. All User Messages:\n   - "아래 작업을 진행하라. 1. roleMenuMapping 마이그레이션 (admin-service) - 메뉴 권한 관리 기능 2. logAnalytics 마이그레이션 (common-service) - 로그 분석 기능 3. Swagger 통합 - API 문서화 (선택적)"\n   - "지금까지 변경사항을 git 에 commit push 하라."\n   - "main branch 와 현재 branch를 비교하여 PR을 발행하고자 하는데 그 내용을 markdown 으로 출력해 줘."\n   - "위 내용을 markdown 으로 출력하라."\n   - "서버에서 배포를 시도하고 있다. docker compose build 를 통해 빌드하는데 오류가 발생한다. 오류의 원인을 진단하고 해결책을 제시하라." (with error logs showing `tsc: not found`)\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - Git commit and push the Dockerfile fixes\n   - Verify Dock