rvice:**\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/auth/services/authService.ts`\n     - Main authentication logic: login, MFA, token refresh, logout, register\n     - Uses redis for MFA codes and token blacklisting\n   \n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/auth/services/userSettingsService.ts`\n     - User preferences management with flat DB columns to nested object mapping\n   \n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/auth/routes/auth.ts`\n     - Routes: /login, /verify-mfa, /resend-mfa, /refresh, /logout, /register, /validate, /me, /health\n   \n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/auth/routes/userSettings.ts`\n     - Routes: GET/PUT /, PATCH /:section, POST /reset, GET /all, GET /user/:userId\n\n   **Admin Module - Core Service:**\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/types.ts`\n     - Comprehensive types: User, Role, Menu, Program, UserRoleMapping, RoleProgramMapping, UserPreferences, etc.\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/utils/searchHelper.ts`\n     ```typescript\n     export function buildUserSearchCondition(searchTerm: string, paramIndex: number): { condition: string; param: string | null }\n     export function buildMenuSearchCondition(searchTerm: string, paramIndex: number): { condition: string; param: string | null }\n     export function cleanSearchTerm(searchTerm: string): string\n     ```\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/utils/multiLangTransform.ts`\n     ```typescript\n     export function transformMultiLangFields(dbRecord: any, fieldNames: string[]): any\n     export function flattenMultiLangFields(apiRecord: any, fieldNames: string[]): any\n     export function snakeToCamel(str: string): string\n     export function transformKeysToCamelCase(dbRecord: any): any\n     ```\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/userService.ts`\n     - Functions: getAllUsers, getUserCount, getUserById, getUserByLoginId, getUserByEmail, createUser, updateUser, deleteUser, loginidExists, emailExists\n\n   -