e455b8b7-d02c-4b71-9a1d-08bda4fb382f	ffb64355-2ee5-4f0a-a363-219cf71734ef	assistant	**Phase 2 (core-service 생성) 완료!**\n\n## 요약\n\nCore Service가 성공적으로 생성되었습니다:\n\n### 생성된 구조\n```\nservices/core-service/\n├── src/\n│   ├── modules/\n│   │   ├── auth/          # 인증 모듈\n│   │   │   ├── routes/    (auth, userSettings)\n│   │   │   └── services/  (authService, userService, userSettingsService)\n│   │   ├── admin/         # 관리자 모듈\n│   │   │   ├── routes/    (user, role, menu, department, program, mappings)\n│   │   │   └── services/  (7개 서비스)\n│   │   └── common/        # 공통 모듈\n│   │       ├── routes/    (code, attachment, log, dashboard, appSettings 등)\n│   │       ├── services/  (6개 서비스)\n│   │       ├── utils/     (multiLangTransform, fileUpload)\n│   │       └── types.ts\n│   ├── middleware/        (authMiddleware, rateLimiter)\n│   ├── utils/             (database, jwt, password, redis)\n│   ├── swagger.ts         # 통합 API 문서\n│   └── server.ts          # 통합 서버\n├── Dockerfile\n├── package.json\n├── tsconfig.json\n├── .env\n└── .env.example\n```\n\n### 통합된 API 엔드포인트\n- **Auth Module**: `/auth/*` (login, logout, register, refresh, mfa, user-settings)\n- **Admin Module**: `/admin/*` (users, roles, menus, departments, programs, mappings)\n- **Common Module**: `/common/*` (codes, attachments, logs, dashboard, app-settings)\n\n### 테스트 결과\n- Health check: ✅ 정상\n- Auth API (login): ✅ 정상 응답\n- Common API (public settings): ✅ 정상 응답\n\nPhase 3 (app-service 생성)을 진행하시겠습니까?	text	\N	616	f	f	\N	\N	2025-12-10 22:02:53.261+00
