b292f461-2f7e-40ce-9f9f-13713e20c7b5	0b487435-fec3-4b0d-9add-c25cf4b49be4	assistant	완료되었습니다. 변경 내용 요약:\n\n## PostgreSQL 서비스 추가 완료\n\n### 추가된 서비스\n\n```yaml\npostgres:\n  image: postgres:16.11\n  container_name: corenext-postgres\n  ports:\n    - "9090:5432"\n  volumes:\n    - pg16_pgdata_16_11:/var/lib/postgresql/data\n  healthcheck:\n    test: pg_isready -U corenext -d corenextdb\n```\n\n### 서비스 의존성\n\n```\npostgres (DB) ──┬──> backend ──> frontend\n               │\n               └──> auth-service\n                        │\nredis ──────────────────┘\n```\n\n### 실행 방법\n\n```bash\n# 1. 볼륨 생성 (최초 1회)\ndocker volume create pg16_pgdata_16_11\n\n# 2. 서비스 시작\ncd infrastructure/docker\ndocker-compose up -d\n\n# 3. 모니터링 포함 시작 (선택)\ndocker-compose --profile monitoring up -d\n```\n\n### 환경변수 (.env 파일 필요)\n\n```env\nDB_NAME=corenextdb\nDB_USER=corenext\nDB_PASSWORD=<REDACTED>\nJWT_SECRET=<REDACTED>\nJWT_REFRESH_SECRET=<REDACTED>\n```	text	\N	513	f	f	\N	\N	2025-12-08 15:35:35.047+00
