mmon modules\n     - **app-service (3012)**: content + communication modules\n   - Option C (API Gateway) to be implemented later\n   - User approved and requested implementation of Phase 1 (Shared library expansion) and Phase 2 (core-service creation)\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MSA (Microservices Architecture) consolidation\n   - Strangler Fig Pattern for gradual migration\n   - TypeScript with Express.js\n   - PostgreSQL with pg Pool\n   - JWT authentication with access/refresh tokens\n   - Redis with in-memory fallback for token blacklist/session\n   - Rate limiting middleware\n   - Multi-language field transformation (ko, en, zh, vi)\n   - Docker multi-stage builds\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   **Plan Document:**\n   - `docs/msa-consolidation-plan.md` (612 lines)\n     - Complete consolidation plan with 5 phases, 30 tasks\n     - Service routing maps, directory structures, nginx config changes\n\n   **Phase 1 - Shared Library Files:**\n   \n   - `shared/database/index.ts` - pg Pool based database module\n     ```typescript\n     export async function query(text: string, params?: any[]): Promise<QueryResult> {\n       const pool = getPool();\n       const result = await pool.query(text, params);\n       return result;\n     }\n     export async function queryOne(text: string, params?: any[]): Promise<any | null>\n     export async function queryMany(text: string, params?: any[]): Promise<any[]>\n     export async function getClient(): Promise<PoolClient>\n     export async function withTransaction<T>(callback: (client: PoolClient) => Promise<T>): Promise<T>\n     ```\n\n   - `shared/auth/jwt.ts` - JWT utilities\n     ```typescript\n     export function generateAccessToken(payload: Omit<TokenPayload, 'type' | 'iat' | 'exp'>): string\n     export function generateRefreshToken(payload: Omit<TokenPayload, 'type' | 'iat' | 'exp'>): string\n     export function verifyAccessToken(token: string): TokenPayload\n     export function verifyRefreshToken(token