Files Created/Modified**:\n   - All core-service module files under src/modules/auth/ and src/modules/admin/\n   - No errors encountered in this session\n\n6. **Todo List Status**:\n   - P2-01: core-service project creation - completed\n   - P2-02: auth module migration - completed\n   - P2-03: admin module migration - in_progress (nearly complete)\n   - P2-04: common module migration - pending\n   - P2-05: integrated server.ts - pending\n   - P2-06: Swagger integration - pending\n   - P2-07: Dockerfile - pending\n   - P2-08: Build and test - pending\n\n7. **User Messages**:\n   - No explicit user messages in this session - it was a continuation with instruction to proceed without asking questions\n\n8. **Current Work**:\n   - Just completed creating all admin module routes\n   - Admin module migration is essentially complete\n   - Next would be P2-04 (common module) or finishing any remaining admin module items\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   - User wants to consolidate 5 MSA services into 2 services for efficient operation (Option B)\n   - **core-service (port 3011)**: Combines auth + admin + common modules\n   - **app-service (port 3012)**: Combines content + communication modules (future Phase 3)\n   - Current task: Phase 2 - core-service creation, specifically completing auth and admin module migration\n   - User instruction: "Phase 2 (core-service 생성)를 진행하라" (Proceed with Phase 2 core-service creation)\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MSA consolidation using Strangler Fig Pattern\n   - TypeScript with Express.js\n   - PostgreSQL with pg Pool for database\n   - JWT authentication (access/refresh tokens)\n   - Redis with in-memory fallback for token blacklist\n   - Rate limiting middleware (express-rate-limit)\n   - Multi-language field transformation (ko, en, zh, vi)\n   - Role-based access control (RBAC) with program permissions\n   - Full-text search using PostgreSQL's to_tsvector\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n\n   **Auth Module - Core Service:**\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/auth/services/authService.ts`\n     - Main authentication logic: login, MFA, token refresh, logout, register\n     - Uses redis for MFA codes and token blacklisting\n   \n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/auth/services/userSettingsService.ts`\n     - User preferences management with flat DB columns to nested object mapping\n   \n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/auth/routes/auth.ts`\n     - Routes: /login, /verify-mfa, /resend-mfa, /refresh, /logout, /register, /validate, /me, /health\n   \n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/auth/routes/userSettings.ts`\n     - Routes: GET/PUT /, PATCH /:section, POST /reset, GET /all, GET /user/:userId\n\n   **Admin Module - Core Service:**\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/types.ts`\n     - Comprehensive types: User, Role, Menu, Program, UserRoleMapping, RoleProgramMapping, UserPreferences, etc.\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/utils/searchHelper.ts`\n     ```typescript\n     export function buildUserSearchCondition(searchTerm: string, paramIndex: number): { condition: string; param: string | null }\n     export function buildMenuSearchCondition(searchTerm: string, paramIndex: number): { condition: string; param: string | null }\n     export function cleanSearchTerm(searchTerm: string): string\n     ```\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/utils/multiLangTransform.ts`\n     ```typescript\n     export function transformMultiLangFields(dbRecord: any, fieldNames: string[]): any\n     export function flattenMultiLangFields(apiRecord: any, fieldNames: string[]): any\n     export function snakeToCamel(str: string): string\n     export function transformKeysToCamelCase(dbRecord: any): any\n     ```\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/userService.ts`\n     - Functions: getAllUsers, getUserCount, getUserById, getUserByLoginId, getUserByEmail, createUser, updateUser, deleteUser, loginidExists, emailExists\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/roleService.ts`\n     - Functions: getAllRoles, getRoleById, getRoleByName, createRole, updateRole, deleteRole, countUsersByRole\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/menuService.ts`\n     - Functions: getAllMenus, getMenuById, getMenuByCode, getMenuByPath, getChildMenus, createMenu, updateMenu, deleteMenu, getUserMenus\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/departmentService.ts`\n     - Functions: getAllDepartments, getDepartmentById, getDepartmentByCode, getDepartmentsByParentId, createDepartment, updateDepartment, deleteDepartment\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/programService.ts`\n     - Functions: getAllPrograms, getProgramById, getProgramByCode, createProgram, updateProgram, deleteProgram, getCategories, getTypes\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/userRoleMappingService.ts`\n     - Functions: getAllMappings, getMappingsByUserId, getMappingsByRoleId, getMappingById, mappingExists, createMapping, updateMapping, deleteMapping, deleteMappingsByUserId, deleteMappingsByRoleId\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/roleProgramMappingService.ts`\n     - Functions: getAllMappings, getMappingsByRoleId, getMappingById, mappingExists, createMapping, updateMapping, deleteMapping, deleteMappingsByRoleId\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/permissionService.ts`\n     - Functions: getUserRoleMappings, getAllRoleProgramMappings, getAllPrograms, getProgramByCode, getUserProgramPermissions, getUserAccessiblePrograms, isUserAdmin\n\n   - `services/core-service/src/modules/admin/services/preferencesService.ts`\n     - Functions: getUserPreferences, createUserPreferences, updateUserPreferences, deleteUserPreferences\n\n   - **Admin Routes Created:**\n     - `routes/user.ts` - User CRUD, preferences, permissions, profile, password reset\n     - `routes/role.ts` - Role CRUD with user count validation\n     - `routes/menu.ts` - Menu CRUD with tree building, user menu access\n     - `routes/department.ts` - Department CRUD with tree/flat support\n     - `routes/program.ts` - Program CRUD with categories/types\n     - `routes/userRoleMapping.ts` - User-Role mapping CRUD\n     - `routes/roleProgramMapping.ts` - Role-Program permissions CRUD\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - No errors encountered in this session - all files were created successfully\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Successfully migrated auth module from auth-service to core-service modules/auth\n   - Successfully migrated admin module from admin-service to core-service modules/admin\n   - Adapted import paths from '../utils/database' to '../../../utils/database' for module structure\n   - Maintained consistent API response formats and function signatures\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - This was a continuation session with instruction: "Please continue the conversation from where we left it off without asking the user any further questions. Continue with the last task that you were asked to work on."\n   - Original request from previous session: "Phase 2 (core-service 생성)를 진행하라."\n\n7. Pending Tasks:\n   - P2-04: common 모듈 이전 (common module migration)\n   - P2-05: 통합 server.ts 작성 (integrated server.ts)\n   - P2-06: Swagger 통합 (Swagger integration)\n   - P2-07: Dockerfile 작성 (Dockerfile)\n   - P2-08: 빌드 및 테스트 (Build and test)\n\n8. Current Work:\n   - Just completed creating all admin module routes for core-service:\n     - user.ts, role.ts, menu.ts, department.ts, program.ts, userRoleMapping.ts, roleProgramMapping.ts\n     - routes/index.ts and admin/index.ts exports\n   - Admin module migration (P2-03) is essentially complete\n   - Todo list shows P2-03 as "in_progress" - should be marked completed\n\n9. Optional Next Step:\n   Continue with **P2-04: common 모듈 이전** (common module migration)\n   \n   Need to:\n   1. Check common-service structure and files\n   2. Create common module in core-service at `src/modules/